  "description": "CentralWatch AWS service activity derived from traces in Tempo. Each table lists traces containing spans for the given AWS service (S3.PutObject/DeleteObject/ListBuckets, Lambda.Invoke, SNS publish (\"centralwatch-notifications send\"), SQS.SendMessage/ReceiveMessage/DeleteMessageBatch, DynamoDB.PutItem/GetItem/Query/Scan/DeleteItem). Click a row to load its trace into the AWS Trace Waterfall. NOTE: TraceQL uses the verified AWS span-name contract; no aggregates are used because they require Tempo >= 2.4.",
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "id": null,
  "links": [],
  "liveNow": false,
